              "requirementId": "R13",
              "issue": "parseJson() converts malformed canonical state, Spec, and catalog JSON into CANONICAL_RECORD_INCONSISTENT, but canonical parse failures must be reported as CANONICAL_RECORD_UNREADABLE.",
              "suggestion": "Update parseJson() to emit CANONICAL_RECORD_UNREADABLE for JSON decoding failures while retaining CANONICAL_RECORD_INCONSISTENT for post-parse identity, schema, and integrity validation.",
              "disposition": "must-fix",
              "rationale": "R13 mandates UNREADABLE for canonical parse failures; the current implementation emits a contradictory public error code.",
