              "failureMode": "spec_behavior_contradiction",
              "file": "src/flow/query.js",
              "requirementId": "R12",
              "issue": "runFlowQueryCli() includes selectedFlowVersion and availableFlowVersions for every QueryRequest error except SPEC_NOT_FOUND and FLOW_VERSION_NOT_FOUND. Therefore INVALID_CURSOR responses expose the discovered Version, contradicting the required null selection for invalid selection errors and the integration fixture expectation.",
